+query. The contract asks for one short paragraph or up to four bullets, no
+preamble/tool narration/raw transcripts, and a conservative character cap by
+reasoning level (minimal 500, low 700, medium 900, high 1100, max 1300). If a
+useful answer cannot fit, the model may return `NO_CONCISE_HONCHO_RESULT`,
+which Hermes treats as an empty/degraded dialectic result rather than injecting
+partial memory context. This protects self-hosted local-Qwen deployments from
+wasting a full generation that ends at `finish_reason='length'`; it does not
+relax Honcho's correctness guard against truncated outputs.
